    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The Utility operating companies are transmission owning members of the Midcontinent Independent System Operator (MISO) RTO. MISO is the transmission provider under the MISO Attachment O. Entergy Louisiana incurred charges from MISO for the purchase of network transmission service under the MISO Attachment O. MISO calculated the network service charges applicable to Entergy Louisiana and billed the entity for such service.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Network upgrade charges incurred from MISO under the MISO Attachment O. Rates are calculated under Attachment GG. Charges are related to the MTEP (MISO Transmission Expansion Plan).</link:footnote>
